      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have always had a memory leak in vrchat. I just presumed it was my system. If others are getting it then perhaps it is a game issue. My situation: After 2 hours of sitting in a popular room, with people entering and leaving constantly, vrchat's ram usage exceeds 12GB. Even changing rooms it will stay higher than when the game was first launched and eventually vrchat will cause my system to run out of ram. The only fix is to force close the application (because it freezes on trying to exit through the menu) and load the game again.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
